# Pairs with LinkGateMatchesLinking. Two concurrent links could otherwise both record against the same parent.
MODULE: RootLinksWithoutGate
TARGET: LinkGateMatchesLinking
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root hands the link on without taking its link gate
PERTURBS: RootRecordLink

--- FIND
    /\ linkGate' = TRUE
    /\ chain' = "parent"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is not taken
    /\ linkGate' = FALSE
    /\ chain' = "parent"
--- END
